+    config.open_gl.fbo_reset_after_present = false;
+    // make_resource_current is deliberately null. Providing it would tell the
+    // engine it may upload textures from the IO thread on a second context,
+    // and the layer has exactly one -- GXM's, process-wide. Leaving it null keeps
+    // every GL call on the raster thread, which is what makes the no-op
+    // make_current above correct.
+    //
+    // populate_existing_damage is also null, so every frame is a full repaint.
+    // ADR-0007's partial repaint is a software-path property today; wiring the
+    // GL equivalent needs damage tracked per back buffer against GXM's
